problem: macOS CI restored stale cached cargo shims causing cargo to invoke rustup-init
approach: Bumped workflow cache keys/prefixes to avoid restoring poisoned ~/.cargo/bin caches while preserving existing valid workflow syntax
failed_paths:
  - Removing ~/.cargo/bin entries exposed workflow formatting fragility and made workflows invalid
verification:
  - PyYAML parsed all workflow files locally
  - Prior CI logs showed rustup-init handling cargo build from stale cache
workflow_learning: For fragile workflow YAML, prefer low-risk cache-key busts over structural rewrites unless fully reformatting the file
related_files:
  - .github/workflows/rust-ci.yml
  - .github/workflows/pr-check.yml
  - .github/workflows/release-beta-on-push.yml
  - .github/workflows/release.yml
